    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present No. 8 Aderrig Walk - a beautifully presented three-bedroom mid-terrace home ideally positioned within a highly regarded modern development in Lucan. Offering bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout, this attractive residence is complemented by a private south-facing rear garden and a contemporary finish, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families, or investors seeking a turnkey home in a convenient location.\n\nOn entering the property, a welcoming hallway with tiled flooring sets the tone for the accommodation within, leading through to a bright and comfortable living room to the front. This space is filled with natural light from a large window overlooking greenery, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. Finished in soft neutral tones with modern lighting and decorative features, it provides an excellent setting for both relaxing and entertaining.\nTo the rear, the heart of the home lies in the spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area. The kitchen is fitted with sleek, contemporary units, integrated appliances, and ample countertop space, all presented in a clean and modern style. A large window above the sink overlooks the garden, enhancing the sense of light and connection to the outdoors. The dining area is generous in size and comfortably accommodates a family table, making it perfectly suited for everyday living and hosting alike.\nUpstairs, the accommodation continues to impress with three well-proportioned bedrooms. The principal bedroom is located to the rear and enjoys a private outlook over the garden, creating restful environment. It comfortably accommodates a double bed along with additional storage and benefits from a modern ensuite, finished with a fully tiled shower enclosure, contemporary sanitary ware, and natural light from a window. A second double bedroom to the front is similarly bright and spacious, offering flexibility for a variety of uses, while the third bedroom is ideal as a child's room, nursery, or home office, with good natural light and a practical layout.\nThe main family bathroom is finished in a modern style and features a full-size bath with overhead shower and glass screen, complemented by neutral tiling, a contemporary wash hand basin, WC, and a chrome heated towel rail, creating a clean and functional space for everyday use.\nOutside, the rear garden is a standout feature of the home. Benefiting from a desirable south-facing aspect, it is predominantly laid in lawn and fully enclosed by timber fencing, providing a private and secure setting. The space is ideal for families, outdoor dining, or relaxing in the sun, while also offering scope for further landscaping or the addition of a patio area. To the front, the property enjoys a modern façade within a well-maintained development, contributing to its overall appeal.\nSituated within easy reach of local shops, schools, parks, and excellent transport links, including access to the N4, M50, and public transport routes, the location offers both convenience and a strong sense of community. The Crossings shopping centre is just a short distance away, providing a wide range of cafés, restaurants, and amenities. While the expansive Tandy's Park offers a selection of recreational facilities and large green spaces.\nThis is a stylish and well-maintained home that combines modern living with a practical layout and a highly convenient setting, sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers seeking quality and comfort in a popular residential area."
      },
